  "body": "<!-- docker-image-provenance:start -->\n## Docker Image Provenance\n\n**Image Reference:** `docker.io/schemacrawler/schemacrawler@sha256:bf9c1e9e823e86492a64b181e4dbc73fab367aa13c5e64452ee042a1cd62ea81`\n\n**Digest:** `sha256:bf9c1e9e823e86492a64b181e4dbc73fab367aa13c5e64452ee042a1cd62ea81`\n\n**Attestation Status:** Signed provenance available\n\n[View attestation](https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/attestations/70924788)\n<!-- docker-image-provenance:end -->\n\nSchemaCrawler  release at last commit 9c22b5c1dd0b3ca5c9391b01f3603f60c6c3a42b\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Rename method by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2566\n* Fix Database Integration Tests running out of disk on ubuntu-26.04 runners by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2565\n* Bump org.thymeleaf:thymeleaf from 3.1.6.RELEASE to 3.1.7.RELEASE by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2569\n* Bump com.clickhouse:clickhouse-jdbc from 0.11.1 to 0.11.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2567\n* Rework SchemaCrawler Shell, and use JLine 4 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2570\n* v18.0.4 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2571\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v18.0.3...v18.0.4",
